<section class="alpine-section" id="residential">
  <div class="alpine-container">
    <div class="alpine-sentinel"><strong>§ 01</strong>Residential inspection</div>
    <h2>Sized to the home, not to the contract.</h2>
    <p style="max-width:60ch;color:var(--al-text);margin-bottom:2.5rem">Three tiers based on heated square footage. Detached structures (garages, ADUs, casitas) priced separately. Older-than-1960 surcharge applies for the extra time involved.</p>

    <div class="alpine-report-grid">
      <div class="alpine-report-item">
        <div class="alpine-report-num">§ 01.01</div>
        <div class="alpine-report-body">
          <h3>Up to 2,500 sq ft &mdash; $525</h3>
          <p>Base residential inspection. Roof walked when safe, attic entered, crawl space crawled. 3&ndash;4 hours on site. Report delivered in 24 business hours.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="alpine-report-field">
          <strong>Fits</strong>
          Most ranches and townhouses across the Pikes Peak region. Single-story or 1.5-story homes built 1960&ndash;present.
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="alpine-report-item">
        <div class="alpine-report-num">§ 01.02</div>
        <div class="alpine-report-body">
          <h3>2,500&ndash;4,000 sq ft &mdash; $625</h3>
          <p>Same scope, larger home. Typically 4&ndash;5 hours on site. Two-inspector team for jobs over 3,500 sq ft so we can keep pace without compromising thoroughness.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="alpine-report-field">
          <strong>Fits</strong>
          Most mid-size two-story homes in Briargate, Black Forest, Monument, and Mountain Shadows.
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="alpine-report-item">
        <div class="alpine-report-num">§ 01.03</div>
        <div class="alpine-report-body">
          <h3>Over 4,000 sq ft &mdash; quoted</h3>
          <p>Custom homes, multi-wing properties, mountain estates. Quoted after a 5-minute site walk-through. Typically $725&ndash;$1,200 depending on square footage and complexity.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="alpine-report-field">
          <strong>Fits</strong>
          Custom builds in Cordera, Skyway, Cheyenne Cañon, and the Black Forest acreage market.
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="alpine-report-item">
        <div class="alpine-report-num">§ 01.04</div>
        <div class="alpine-report-body">
          <h3>Pre-1960 surcharge &mdash; +$95</h3>
          <p>Older homes take longer to inspect properly &mdash; knob &amp; tube to look for, cast iron drainage to camera-scope, plaster walls to read for moisture.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="alpine-report-field">
          <strong>Note</strong>
          Waived if the home has been comprehensively renovated and the seller can document recent electrical/plumbing/HVAC permits.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

